  "__class__": "Meeting",
  "transcript": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": "00:14:23.910",
      "end": "00:14:26.430",
      "text": "Good afternoon folks, it's just after 12 p.m."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": "00:14:26.430",
      "end": "00:14:27.970",
      "text": "I'd like to call a special meeting"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": "00:14:27.970",
      "end": "00:14:31.660",
      "text": "of the Planning Environment Committee to order."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": "00:14:31.660",
      "end": "00:14:33.030",
      "text": "Please check the city website"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": "00:14:33.030",
      "end": "00:14:34.870",
      "text": "for additional meeting, detail, and information."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": "00:14:34.870",
      "end": "00:14:38.060",
      "text": "Meetings can be viewed via live streaming on YouTube"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": "00:14:38.060",
      "end": "00:14:40.000",
      "text": "and the city website."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": "00:14:40.000",
      "end": "00:14:42.250",
      "text": "The city of London is situated on the traditional lands"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": "00:14:42.250",
      "end": "00:14:44.790",
      "text": "of the Anishinaabek, Haudenosaunee,"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": "00:14:44.790",
      "end": "00:14:46.940",
      "text": "Lenapeiwok, and Adawangran."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": "00:14:46.940",
      "end": "00:14:48.980",
      "text": "We honor and respect the history, languages,"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": "00:14:48.980",
      "end": "00:14:50.950",
      "text": "and culture of the diverse indigenous people"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": "00:14:50.950",
      "end": "00:14:53.200",
      "text": "who call this territory home."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": "00:14:53.200",
      "end": "00:14:54.530",
      "text": "The city of London is currently home"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": "00:14:54.530",
      "end": "00:14:57.690",
      "text": "to many First Nations, Metis, and Inuit today."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": "00:14:57.690",
      "end": "00:15:00.290",
      "text": "As representatives of the people of the city of London,"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": "00:15:00.290",
      "end": "00:15:01.740",
      "text": "we are grateful to have the opportunity"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": "00:15:01.740",
      "end": "00:15:05.260",
      "text": "to work and live in this territory."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": "00:15:05.260",
      "end": "00:15:07.350",
      "text": "The city of London is committed to making every effort"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": "00:15:07.350",
      "end": "00:15:10.020",
      "text": "to provide alternate formats and communication supports"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": "00:15:10.020",
      "end": "00:15:12.280",
      "text": "for meetings upon request."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": "00:15:12.280",
      "end": "00:15:14.780",
      "text": "To make a request specific to this meeting,"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": "00:15:14.780",
      "end": "00:15:17.620",
      "text": "please contact PACPTC at London.ca"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": "00:15:17.620",
      "end": "00:15:22.870",
      "text": "or 519-661-2489 extension-2425"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": "00:15:22.870",
      "end": "00:15:24.780",
      "text": "that this time I'll look for any disclosures"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": "00:15:24.780",
      "end": "00:15:27.750",
      "text": "of pecuniary interest."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": "00:15:27.750",
      "end": "00:15:29.990",
      "text": "Seeing none, there are no consent items,"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": "00:15:29.990",
      "end": "00:15:33.090",
      "text": "there are no scheduled items, items for direction,"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": "00:15:33.090",
      "end": "00:15:35.890",
      "text": "or deferred matters, additional business."
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": "00:15:35.890",
      "end": "00:15:38.400",
      "text": "The next item is confidential,"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": "00:15:38.400",
      "end": "00:15:40.860",
      "text": "and I'll look for motion to go in camera."
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": "00:15:40.860",
      "end": "00:15:48.590",
      "text": "Councilor Frank, seconded by Councilor Raman."
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": "00:15:48.590",
      "end": "00:15:57.340",
      "text": "I'll call the vote."
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": "00:15:57.340",
      "end": "00:15:58.600",
      "text": "There, can I vote verbally?"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": "00:15:58.600",
      "end": "00:16:00.280",
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": "00:16:00.280",
      "end": "00:16:02.300",
      "text": "That's fine, thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": "00:16:02.300",
      "end": "00:16:08.210",
      "text": "Thank you, I vote yes."
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": "00:16:08.210",
      "end": "00:16:13.510",
      "text": "Wasn't the vote, the motion carries forward to zero."
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": "00:16:13.510",
      "end": "00:16:14.930",
      "text": "Thank you, so I'll look for the clerk"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": "00:16:14.930",
      "end": "00:16:17.880",
      "text": "to prepare the room."
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": "00:16:17.880",
      "end": "00:16:24.990",
      "text": "I'm sorry."
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": "00:16:24.990",
      "end": "00:17:02.220",
      "text": "Boarding in progress, recording stopped."
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": "00:17:02.220",
      "end": "00:17:04.620",
      "text": "Okay, folks, we're back."
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": "00:17:04.620",
      "end": "00:17:06.690",
      "text": "I'm going to go to the clerk."
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": "00:17:06.690",
      "end": "00:17:09.490",
      "text": "I made a mistake by not giving a reason"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": "00:17:09.490",
      "end": "00:17:11.380",
      "text": "for going in camera in the first place,"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": "00:17:11.380",
      "end": "00:17:14.780",
      "text": "so I'll go to the clerk now to give that information."
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": "00:17:14.780",
      "end": "00:17:16.640",
      "text": "Through the chair, the committee went in camera"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": "00:17:16.640",
      "end": "00:17:18.780",
      "text": "to discuss a matter pertaining to advice"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": "00:17:18.780",
      "end": "00:17:21.830",
      "text": "that is subject to solicitor client privilege,"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": "00:17:21.830",
      "end": "00:17:25.060",
      "text": "including communications necessary for that purpose,"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": "00:17:25.060",
      "end": "00:17:26.810",
      "text": "from the solicitor and officers"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": "00:17:26.810",
      "end": "00:17:29.020",
      "text": "or employees of the corporation,"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": "00:17:29.020",
      "end": "00:17:31.280",
      "text": "and litigation or potential litigation"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": "00:17:31.280",
      "end": "00:17:35.550",
      "text": "with respect to appeals related to 1156 Dentistry"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": "00:17:35.550",
      "end": "00:17:37.460",
      "text": "at the Ontario Land Tribunal,"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": "00:17:37.460",
      "end": "00:17:40.210",
      "text": "and for the purpose of providing instructions and directions"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": "00:17:40.210",
      "end": "00:17:44.200",
      "text": "to officers and employees of the corporation."
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": "00:17:44.200",
      "end": "00:17:48.130",
      "text": "Thank you, and I'll go to Councilor Frank to report out."
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": "00:17:48.130",
      "end": "00:17:51.070",
      "text": "Thank you, I'd like to report that progress has been made."
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": "00:17:51.070",
      "end": "00:17:53.830",
      "text": "Thank you, and they're seeing no other business"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": "00:17:53.830",
      "end": "00:17:57.060",
      "text": "for the committee, I'll look for a motion to adjourn."
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": "00:17:57.060",
      "end": "00:18:01.280",
      "text": "Councilor Frank, seconded by Councilor Raman."
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": "00:18:01.280",
      "end": "00:18:04.180",
      "text": "Call vote, hand vote."
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": "00:18:04.180",
      "end": "00:18:06.600",
      "text": "closing the vote, the motion carries 4-0."
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": "00:18:06.600",
      "end": "00:18:07.870",
      "text": "Meeting adjourned, thanks folks."
    }
